"""Train-time validation for conditional response variants in ``responses.yml``.

Project validation loads each ``responses.yml`` leniently: unknown variant keys
and other parse problems become
:class:`~rasa.mantle.validation_finding.ValidationFinding` entries so every
project file is checked. Runtime model load still uses strict
:meth:`~rasa.mantle.content.responses.ResponseRegistry.from_yaml`, which raises
on the first parse error.

This module also validates parsed variant shape: non-empty text, condition
syntax, readable memory references, static button payloads, and default-variant
rules.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

